  A: frozen 12.10.1 through the v13.0 harness reproduces cb_v12101 exactly
     (max|diff| = 0), gate NULL_CONTROL_OK on all 5 subsets.
  B: rebuilt v13.0 with BA_GAIN=0 and identity anchor reproduces cb_v12101 exactly
     (max|diff| = 0), gate NULL_CONTROL_OK on all 5 subsets.
  E: joint candidate is byte identical to the July cb_v130b100 artifact (max|diff| = 0).

